=== Setsusha ===

=== Sessha ===
* Niu Shrine
** Enshrined deity: Yatsunami no Mikoto
:: It is also called the "main shrine" because it is located on the former site of the shrine on the opposite bank of the Mitarai River (Takami River)<ref>{{Cite web|Japanese book|url=https://niukawakami-jinja.jp/keidai/#keidai_17|title=Setssha/Nyu Shrine/Guide to the precincts|accessdate=2021.11.9|publisher=Nyu Kawakami Shrine}}</ref>. The main shrine is {{ill|lt=Kasugazukuri|Q3193781|WD=Q3193781|1=Kasuga-zukuri}} thatched roof.
:: According to the above-mentioned, {{ill|lt=Keian|Q1146135|WD=Q1146135|1=Keian}} 3rd year, it was enshrined at that time. By the way, in the {{ill|lt=1915|Q2084|WD=Q2084|1=1915}} (Taisho 4) ``Permission to change the deity enshrined at shrines and change the company name,'' our company ``transferred the Goryodai to the head office and enshrined the appropriate Goryodai at Nyu Shrine.''
